# The maintainers review every change of the repository; once the branch rules require a code
# owner's review, none is merged without one of them. What judges a pull request is named too:
# the workflows, the policy data (the exceptions and payload IDs registries among them), the
# schemas, the conformance vectors, the tools and their tests, and their configuration. The pull
# request workflow takes a pull request's policy exceptions only while this file names an owner
# of the policy data.
